{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Ultranatural</strong>, a no-frills PvP arena shooter built for quick, competitive fun. This is a student project from S4G Berlin, designed with simplicity in mind to modernize the classic arena shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Ultranatural, you\u2019ll face off against friends on a single, carefully designed map, using one traditional weapon to prove your skills. The focus is on skill-based combat, fast movement, and intense one-on-one or small team matches. With easy-to-host servers, it\u2019s a perfect way to settle who\u2019s the better shot among your group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a fan of old-school shooters or just looking for a quick, straightforward game to play with friends, Ultranatural keeps the action sharp, simple, and fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484710?t=1742212272","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484710?t=1742212272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484710/39d42d8e6e6a5741fc01ade46aab13b1ecda3ec9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742212272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484710/39d42d8e6e6a5741fc01ade46aab13b1ecda3ec9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742212272","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Ultranatural</strong>, a no-frills PvP arena shooter built for quick, competitive fun. This is a student project from S4G Berlin, designed with simplicity in mind to modernize the classic arena shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Ultranatural, you\u2019ll face off against friends on a single, carefully d